<title>CROATIA: Private Croatia Banka 1996 net rises 8.2 percent.</title>
<headline>Private Croatia Banka 1996 net rises 8.2 percent.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-05-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for calendar year 1996</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of kuna unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		    21.39   vs  19.77</p>
<p>    Pretax profit		 27.59   vs  25.66</p>
<p>    Total income		 170.17   vs  171.07</p>
<p>    Total expenses	     142.58   vs  145.41</p>
<p>    Tax				 6.2   vs  5.89</p>
<p>    Dividend (kuna per share)  22.5   vs  21.8</p>
<p>Note - Croatia Banka d.d. is one of Croatia's leading private banks. Results were published in daily newspaper Slobodna Dalmacija.</p>
</text>
